This package reproduces finite results from the same project's gluing_v0_1,
variation_v0_1 and quantum_structure_v0_1 packages. Five files in inputs/ are
unmodified upstream copies. Their original paths, exact Git blob identities
and pinned source URLs are recorded in provenance.json. The new benchmark,
documentation and packaging are a source-based synthesis, not an external
review or independent physical replication. No physical CST-DUST gate is
promoted by these software or algebra controls.
